<Positioned left="48" top="938" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="最优性：R05、R09、R12 是唯三双团队任务（各 2 选 1），共 2³ = 8 种指派已全部枚举。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="966.8" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="每种指派再逐个分支定界，搜索 1032 个节点、未触发安全阀。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="995.6" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="结论：260 分钟是已核验的全局最优，缓冲 160 分钟。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1024.4" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="关键路径下界 255 分钟不紧：实际多 5 分钟，因 R05 与 R04 同要 design。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1100" height="31.2"><Text text="三、排程依据" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="26" color="#0F172A" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR" fontStyle="BOLD"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1134"><Container width="1104" height="1" color="#E3E8EF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1154"><Container width="12" height="12" color="#667085" borderRadius="6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="74" top="1148" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="关键路径 R01→R04→R07→R09→R10→R12 = 255 分钟，整条压在 design 且不插空档。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1184"><Container width="12" height="12" color="#667085" borderRadius="6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="74" top="1178" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="R05 需早于 R07 开始，design 装不下 R04+R05 共 90 分钟，改排 engineering。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1214"><Container width="12" height="12" color="#667085" borderRadius="6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="74" top="1208" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="R09 留在 design：改到 engineering 会让 R10 等 R09 的 250 分钟，整体退到 300。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="1244"><Container width="12" height="12" color="#667085" borderRadius="6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="74" top="1238" height="28.799999999999997"><Text text="R11 放进 engineering 12:25-12:55，正好填 R08 之后的空档，不挤占关键路径。" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#3D4A5C" height="1.0" softWrap="FALSE" textDirection="LTR"/></Positioned>
